3654: 
3655: *** THE TELL IS THE PROCESS, NOT THE SIZE -- and this clause said the opposite until
3656: 2026-08-26. *** It read *"a live run's log grows, and a dead one is exactly 0"*.
3657: **The ledger holds the counter-example in its own records:** `agy` writes NOTHING until
